格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"pipeline-kernel 是管线无关的管理内核：管线 = 配置数据（pipelines 表一行，用 pipelinedefine 定义），内核不绑定任何具体业务。默认无预置管线，由使用者自行定义与部署。","id":"gh:1335960835","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"DSH-pipeline-kernel","slug":"not-big-dog/DSH-pipeline-kernel","topics":["agent","cordis","dsh","dsh-plugin","multi-agent","pipeline"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"pipeline-kernel 是管线无关的管理内核：管线 = 配置数据（pipelines 表一行，用 pipelinedefine 定义），内核不绑定任何具体业务。默认无预置管线，由使用者自行定义"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"line-kernel 是管线无关的管理内核：管线 = 配置数据（pipelines 表一行，用 pipelinedefine 定义），内核不绑定任何具体业务。默认无预置管线，由使用者自行定义与部署。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# pipeline-kernel"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 插件（Cordis）｜ 多 Agent 管线管理内核：任务板 / 台账 / 部署 / 注册表 / 巡检 / 打包复用 / 控制面板\n> A DSH ("},{"id":"p3s2","text":"DeepSeek Harness) Cordis plugin — the management kernel for multi-agent pipelines: task board / ledg"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"er / deployment / registry / watchdog / packaging & reuse / control panel."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**pipeline-kernel 是管线无关的管理内核**：管线 = 配置数据（`pipelines` 表一行，用 `pipeline_define` 定义），内核不绑定任何具体业务。默认**无预置"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" 是管线无关的管理内核**：管线 = 配置数据（`pipelines` 表一行，用 `pipeline_define` 定义），内核不绑定任何具体业务。默认**无预置管线**，由使用者自行定义与部署。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**The kernel is pipeline-agnostic**: a pipeline is just a config row (defined via `pipeline_define`)"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"; no business is baked in. There is **no preset pipeline** — define and deploy your own."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"English · 中文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 中文"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### 定位"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **内核 = 管线无关的管理能力**（通讯 / 台账 / UI 三大职责，见 `docs/`）；**管线 = 数据（配置行）**\n- 业务能力（生图、视频等）是管线内部设置，不进内核\n- 多语言："},{"id":"p9s2","text":"UI 与文档自动跟随 DSH 语言设置（中文 / English）"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### 安装"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"或 `dsh plugin --profile web add <本包路径>`。重启 dsh web 后，**新会话**带 `pipeline_*` 工具（存量会话工具目录固定，需重建会话）。"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"> **依赖要求（v0.9+）：宿主 `deepseek-harness 0.1.0-rc.8` 及以上**（本插件自身锁定 `^0.1.0-rc.8`，cordis 4.x）。开发/CI 用 `pn"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"pm install --frozen-lockfile`。"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### 快速开始"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"1. 定义管线：`pipeline_define {id:\"my-pipe\", roles:{supervisor:{preset:\"pipeline-supervisor\"}, ...}, chai"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"n:[\"supervisor\",...], gates:{...}}`\n2. 起链：`pipeline_deploy {pipelineId:\"my-pipe\"}`\n3. 播种角色会话：`pipeli"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ne_seed {pipelineId:\"my-pipe\"}`（按定义给未注册角色创建会话，自动写注册表）\n4. 投任务：`pipeline_push {title, description, tag"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"s:[\"target:<角色>\",\"task:<编号>\",\"attempt:1\"]}`\n5. 流转：`pipeline_list` → `pipeline_claim` → `pipeline_don"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"e {result:\"done route:<角色|UID> 产物:...\"}`（内核自动路由下一环）\n6. 看全景：`pipeline_status`"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### 控制面板（Web UI）"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"右下角 **pipeline** 胶囊按钮 → 展开右侧全高侧栏："},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- **活动**：各管线运行摘要（角色状态 / 进行中任务 / 最近完成 / 失败置顶）\n- **管线**：管线一等实体（Graph 缩略图 / KPI / 打包产物）；点击任务展开 Task Ins"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"pector\n- **新建**：定义新管线（工作文件夹必选，走系统目录选择器）\n- **归档**：冷存储——归档不删除数据，可恢复；永久删除仅在归档箱内、需输入管线 id 确认"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 巡检（watchdog）"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"v0.8 起 **默认开启**（无需配置）：每 5 分钟扫描 open 任务补唤醒（同任务 10 分钟冷却）、done 但路由未完成（僵尸）自愈补投、全链静止 30 分钟汇报主管。无管线/无任务时零噪"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"音。如需调整或关闭，在 `cordis.patch.yml` 覆写："},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### 文档索引"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| 文档 | 内容 |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| `docs/管线定义规范.md` | 管线定义字段与拓扑规范（roles/chain/gates/entry…） |\n| `docs/内核接口文档.md` | 内核工具与端点清单（pipeline"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"_* / HTTP 路由） |\n| `docs/内核设计文档.md` | 架构与职责划分 |\n| `docs/UI-方案-K7-边栏设计.md` | 控制面板 UI 方案 |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### License"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"MIT"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## English"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Positioning"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- **Kernel = pipeline-agnostic management** (communication / ledger / UI — see `docs/`); **pipeline "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"= data (a config row)**\n- Business capabilities (image generation, video, …) belong inside the pipel"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"ine, not the kernel\n- Bilingual: the UI and docs follow the DSH language setting (中文 / English)"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### Install"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Or `dsh plugin --profile web add <path-to-this-package>`. After restarting dsh web, **new sessions**"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" get the `pipeline_*` tools (existing sessions keep their fixed tool catalog — recreate them)."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"> **Dependency requirement (v0.9+): host `deepseek-harness 0.1.0-rc.8` or newer** (this plugin pins "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"`^0.1.0-rc.8` itself; cordis 4.x). Dev/CI use `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"### Quick start"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"1. Define a pipeline: `pipeline_define {id:\"my-pipe\", roles:{supervisor:{preset:\"pipeline-supervisor"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"\"}, ...}, chain:[\"supervisor\",...], gates:{...}}`\n2. Deploy: `pipeline_deploy {pipelineId:\"my-pipe\"}"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"`\n3. Seed role sessions: `pipeline_seed {pipelineId:\"my-pipe\"}` (creates sessions for unregistered r"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"oles, writes the registry)\n4. Push a task: `pipeline_push {title, description, tags:[\"target:<role>\""},{"id":"p35s5","text":",\"task:<id>\",\"attempt:1\"]}`\n5. Flow: `pipeline_list` → `pipeline_claim` → `pipeline_done {result:\"do"},{"id":"p35s6","text":"ne route:<role|UID> artifacts:...\"}` (auto-routes to the next link)\n6. Overview: `pipeline_status`"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### Control panel (Web UI)"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The **pipeline** pill at the bottom-right expands into a full-height sidebar:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"- **Activity**: per-pipeline run summary (role states / in-progress tasks / recently completed / fai"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"lures on top)\n- **Pipelines**: pipelines as first-class entities (graph thumbnail / KPI / packs); cl"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"icking a task opens the Task Inspector\n- **New**: define a new pipeline (working folder required, pi"},{"id":"p38s4","text":"cked via the system directory picker)\n- **Archive**: cold storage — archiving never deletes data and"},{"id":"p38s5","text":" is reversible; permanent deletion lives only in the archive, requiring the pipeline id to confirm"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"### Watchdog"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"**On by default since v0.8** (no config needed): every 5 minutes it re-wakes open tasks (10-minute c"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"ooldown per task), self-heals zombie tasks (done but routing never finished), and reports stalled ch"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"ains to the supervisor after 30 minutes. Zero noise with no pipelines/tasks. Tune or disable in `cor"},{"id":"p40s4","text":"ervisor after 30 minutes. Zero noise with no pipelines/tasks. Tune or disable in `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"### Docs"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"| Doc | Content |"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"| `docs/管线定义规范.md` | Pipeline definition schema & topology (roles/chain/gates/entry…) |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
